{"diagnosis": "Trace shows TRAP: no progress max_addr=0x00000000 with FAIL 0xdead, meaning no instruction fetch ever completed. Excerpt line 584 drives mem_valid <= mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word (0 on a normal fetch) instead of !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word, so no bus request is issued and CPU stalls in mem_state 1 forever. This contradicts the line 598 assert mem_valid == !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word and explains zero progress.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -581,7 +581,7 @@
 			case (mem_state)
 				0: begin
 					if (mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst || mem_do_rdata) begin
-						mem_valid <= mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
+						mem_valid <= !mem_la_use_prefetched_high_word;
 						mem_instr <= mem_do_prefetch || mem_do_rinst;
 						mem_wstrb <= 0;
 						mem_state <= 1;", "expected": "tohost PASS (no TRAP: no progress, max_addr>0x00000000, progress advancing)"}

